      <p>A senior Boulder digital marketing agency: web design, SEO, social media campaigns, AI visibility and AI consulting.</p>
      <div class="footer-contact">
        <a href="mailto:hello@flatironscreativestudio.com">hello@flatironscreativestudio.com</a>
        <span>Boulder, Colorado</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h6>Services</h6>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/services/web-design-boulder/">Web design &amp; build</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services/ai-clarity-index/">AI Clarity Index</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services/seo-retainer/">SEO retainer</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services/social-media-campaigns/">Social media campaigns</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services/ai-productivity-consulting/">AI productivity consulting</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h6>Company</h6>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/work/">Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about/">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li>
        <li><a href="/book/">Book</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h6>Elsewhere</h6>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://aiclarityindex.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AI Clarity Index ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/trevorcusworth" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bar">
    <span>© 2026 Flatirons Creative Studio · Boulder, Colorado</span>
    <span>Built with intention.</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="/assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
